          "text": "What a massive relief! You had me thoroughly worried for a moment. We couldn't possibly have rewritten those complex equations.",
          "translation": "¡Qué gran alivio! Me tuviste completamente preocupada por un momento. No habríamos podido de ninguna manera reescribir esas ecuaciones complejas."
