          "speaker": "Fiscal de Delitos Complejos (Dra. Lowe)",
          "text": "The defendant was acutely aware that falsifying offshore shipping manifests constituted a blatant breach of statutory embargoes.",
          "translation": "El imputado era plenamente consciente de que falsificar manifiestos de transporte marítimo en ultramar constituía una flagrante infracción de los embargos legales."
